# Suppression rules for examples/mismatched_free.cpp.
#
# Demonstrates that --suppressions covers mismatched frees, not just leaks.
# Vendored code with undefined behaviour you cannot fix has to be acceptable,
# or the tool blocks every build and gets removed from CI.
#
# This covers all four sites in the example, so the run exits 0 -- while the
# report still says, in summary.mismatchesSuppressedByRules and in the HTML
# notice, exactly what was hidden and by which rule.
stack:*mismatched_free.cpp*
